{"lyrics":"[00:05.42]Got pain, woah\n[00:09.54]Mello made it right\n[00:10.52]I got pain in my heart, I told you a hundred times\n[00:19.14]Yeah\n[00:21.20]I got pain in my heart, I told you a hundred times\n[00:23.54]But it's money, money, money, money, money on my mind\n[00:25.10]Put a beam on the glizzy, don't get caught between the lines\n[00:26.64]Last nigga we got busy on got hit between the eyes\n[00:27.84]Roll my problems in a Backwood and put it in the sky\n[00:29.04]Got your mans in this Backwood, put it in the sky\n[00:35.30]I was taught to love my brothers and to hate the other side\n[00:42.06]Hate the other side, hate the other side\n[00:42.94]Bougie off the ecstasy, I might act woo, uh\n[00:44.88]I lost gang members, I can't act cool, uh\n[00:47.54]I got gang scriptures in my tattoos\n[00:49.88]I was runnin' from the police in my trap shoes\n[00:52.46]Posted, tryna flip a hundred, I couldn't buy food\n[00:55.08]Come from nothin', but I blossomed to a tycoon\n[00:57.62]Betrayal scars, can't stop thinkin' 'bout them stab wounds\n[01:00.44]We might not catch him today but he gon' die soon\n[01:03.00]I'm from Chicago, she said she like my accent\n[01:05.68]I'm from Chicago where glocks what we react with\n[01:08.42]Standing tall, make him tumble when that MAC spit\n[01:10.98]Bitch I'm a gangster\n[01:11.84]I just took off on some rap shit\n[01:13.20]I got pain in my heart, I told you a hundred times\n[01:30.94]But it's money, money, money, money, money on my mind\n[01:33.50]Put a beam on the glizzy, don't get caught between the lines\n[01:38.24]Last nigga we got busy on got hit between the eyes\n[01:40.46]Roll my problems in a Backwood and put it in the sky\n[01:42.32]Got your mans in this Backwood, put it in the sky\n[01:44.08]I was taught to love my brothers and to hate the other side\n[01:46.50]Hate the other side (yeah), hate the other side\n[01:47.92]Hate the other side (side), hate the other side\n[01:49.32]Could give a fuck about a bitch, got too much money on my mind\n[01:51.66]Shit I heard they was lookin' for me, I'm not hard to find (find)\n[01:53.14]Everybody that I'm with got nothin' to lose, bitch they gon' ride\n[01:54.94]Saw my uncle in the grave, that brought tears to my eyes\n[01:57.66]But I ain't gon lie, I done been through thi shit too many times\n[02:09.52]My heart's still tryna recover from pain all my life\n[02:12.00]I really been to hell and back a couple hundred times\n[02:14.12]Couple hundred times, read between the lines\n[02:15.82]I'm still tryin', I'm still tryin' to get by (get by)\n[02:17.66]I still got memories that lay deep inside (inside)\n[02:19.72]Creepin' up on my mind, it's fucking us\n[02:21.56]I got pain in my heart, I told you a hundred times\n[02:23.92]But it's money, money, money, money, money on my mind\n[02:25.48]Put a beam on the glizzy, don't get caught between the lines\n[02:30.86]Last nigga we got busy on got hit between the eyes\n[02:32.04]Roll my problems in a Backwood and put it in the sky\n[02:33.78]Got your mans in this Backwood, put it in the sky\n[02:35.06]I was taught to love my brothers and to hate the other side\n[02:36.86]Hate the other side, hate the other side (side)","words":[[5.42,5.46,"Got"],[5.5,5.76,"pain,"],[5.96,8.32,"woah"],[9.54,9.74,"Mello"],[9.84,10.08,"made"],[10.14,10.2,"it"],[10.24,10.48,"right"],[10.52,10.52,"I"],[10.6,10.68,"got"],[10.78,11.08,"pain"],[11.12,11.14,"in"],[11.28,11.48,"my"],[11.52,11.68,"heart,"],[11.72,11.72,"I"],[11.94,12.1,"told"],[12.14,12.22,"you"],[12.42,12.42,"a"],[12.54,12.76,"hundred"],[12.82,13.42,"times"],[19.14,19.32,"Yeah"],[21.2,21.2,"I"],[21.28,21.36,"got"],[21.48,21.76,"pain"],[21.9,21.92,"in"],[21.98,22.14,"my"],[22.18,22.34,"heart,"],[22.38,22.38,"I"],[22.62,22.78,"told"],[22.82,22.9,"you"],[23.08,23.08,"a"],[23.16,23.32,"hundred"],[23.36,23.48,"times"],[23.54,23.62,"But"],[23.66,23.72,"it's"],[23.76,23.84,"money,"],[23.88,23.98,"money,"],[24.02,24.12,"money,"],[24.16,24.38,"money,"],[24.48,24.7,"money"],[2